IES: M.D.C. body, impervious to normal fire and cold, turn invisible at will, bio-regenerate 2D6 M.D.C. per hour as text. ''Prowl 40%'' is stored as the Prowl skill at base 40, per_level 0 (judgement: a flat printed figure with no per-level step). || SKILLS (''Skills of Note'', no bonuses printed, so every percentage is the catalog base): Hand to hand basic or expert is a choice of one, no price printed so no hand_to_hand block. Boxing, Wrestling, Climbing 40, tracking as Tracking (people) 25, Intelligence 32, Radio: Basic 45, pilot hover craft as Hover Craft (ground) 50. ''Three languages'' names none: a choice of three from the catalog''s tongues plus Language: Other, at catalog base (judgement on the list). W.P. Knife, Sword, Blunt and Energy Rifle. ''Game Masters may add skills from the categories of weapon proficiencies, communications, technical, domestic, and wilderness (no bonuses)'' prints no count, so no related or secondary block is stored; it is a restriction line. || BIONICS and WEAPONS: described as common or favorite, not as starting equipment, so text only (restriction line and GM Notes); no equipment_starting. Favorite weapons: heavy energy rifles, bionics and magic weapons, optical enhancements and the occasional hover vehicle. || MONEY: none printed; no starting_money. || ALIGNMENT: ''Selfish or Evil'' allows unprincipled, so no evil tag. Magic powers none, psionics none. Tribe and raiding-band sizes and the Pecos Empire company they keep are lore."
